1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,926
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,927 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 1=

10
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,260
Xiao Yunting, Prince Jing,

11
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,520
(Xiao Yunting, Prince Jing)
has rebelled to seize power.

12
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,840
By order of Prince Qi,
kill him immediately!

13
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,880
- Charge!
- Charge!

14
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,430
(Qi Yuan,)

15
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:03,520
(wait for me.)

16
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,790
(Yuan,)

17
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:29,150
(leaving you alone at the manor
on our wedding night was not my choice.)

18
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:32,000
(If Prince Qi succeeds
in usurping the throne,)

19
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:34,000
(the realm will never know peace.)

20
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,310
(Once I wipe out his faction,)

21
00:01:36,870 --> 00:01:38,870
(I will honor my vow
to grow old with you.)

22
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:49,180
(Prince Qi)

23
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:51,150
Prince Qi?

24
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,220
Why are you here?

25
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,120
Prince Jing feared defeat,

26
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,280
so he handed you over to me

27
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,680
just to spare his own life.

28
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,590
Impossible.

29
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,790
Qi Yuan,

30
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,820
(Qi Yuan, true daughter of Marquis Yongping)
you have nowhere to run.

31
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:11,400
Just behave and stay by my side.

32
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,400
(Since there is no escape,)

33
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:22,910
(then let us die together.)

34
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:34,750
You actually dared to poison me?

35
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:44,000
Qi Yuan,

36
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,030
on the road to the underworld,

37
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,280
don't go too fast.

38
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:59,800
(I was supposed to be
a young lady of the Marquis Residence,)

39
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:03,360
(yet I was swapped and raised
as a rustic butcher's daughter.)

40
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:07,000
(Wicked people conspired
to ruin my reputation,)

41
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:09,870
(and my own family abandoned me,
leaving me adrift for half my life.)

42
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:10,630
Mother.

43
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:12,960
Mother!

44
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:18,360
(Fortunately, Xiao Yunting
saved me from the abyss.)

45
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:20,400
(He said)

46
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:23,430
(I was not only his hidden guard)

47
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,060
(but also his only light.)

48
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:29,400
(Yet on our wedding night,)

49
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,680
(he broke his oath,)

50
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,960
(sold his wife, and betrayed his word.)

51
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,240
(If there is a next life,)

52
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,710
(family,)

53
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,000
(love...)

54
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:40,710
(I want none of it.)

55
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:42,710
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=
(I will raise a blade with my own hands)

56
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,840
(and slaughter
every fate this world has set.)

57
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,080
(Where am I?)

58
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,280
(This is the night
before I returned to the Qi Residence.)

59
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,910
(I didn't die.)

60
00:04:08,430 --> 00:04:10,560
A noble lady who's lost her purity?

61
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,430
Let's see how you
return to the Marquis Residence

62
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:15,310
to steal Jin's wealth and status.

63
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,240
Butcher Xu,

64
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:19,120
she's the real young lady
of the Marquis Residence.

65
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,800
Are you really letting me
have my way with her?

66
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:21,720
Cut the chatter.

67
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,000
Just do as you're told.

68
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,240
Return to the Marquis Residence?

69
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,800
She doesn't have the fate for it.

70
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,430
So what if you're noble-born?

71
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,000
Aren't you still

72
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,480
mine to take?

73
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,740
(Ding Chengyong, local ruffian)

74
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:49,800
My eyes...

75
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,720
It was your foster parents,

76
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,000
Li Xiu

77
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,160
and Butcher Xu.

78
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,190
They wanted me to ruin your purity

79
00:04:59,270 --> 00:05:00,720
so you couldn't return
to the Marquis Residence.

80
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:21,480
Jin is brilliant after all.

81
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:24,720
Now she can sleep easy
in the Marquis Residence.

82
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,720
Still, she's not my flesh
and blood either.

83
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,720
Should I also...

84
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,420
(Butcher Xu: Qi Yuan's adoptive father)

85
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:34,920
No.

86
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,430
No.

87
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,120
Father.

88
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,510
Father, save me!

89
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:40,160
I am coming.

90
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:42,700
(Rakshasa Temple)

91
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,310
Listen up,

92
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,310
folks.

93
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:46,800
A ruined noble lady

94
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,950
ain't worth a thing.

95
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,870
Why don't we tie her up

96
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:51,920
and collect a reward from the Qi family?

97
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:53,270
- Yeah, let's collect the reward.
- Let's go get it.

98
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,070
Xiu, you've done us a huge favor.

99
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,120
How dare you...

100
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,950
Xiu!

101
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:03,360
Someone's dead!

102
00:06:03,530 --> 00:06:04,450
What happened?

103
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:06,630
Let me go.

104
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,830
Let go of me!

105
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,560
You fools!

106
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,800
Li Xiu,

107
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:13,160
(Li Xiu, Qi Yuan's adoptive mother)
you committed adultery with Chengyong,

108
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,950
(Steward, manager of the Qi Estate)
and Butcher Xu caught you.

109
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:16,600
Butcher Xu and Ding Chengyong

110
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,070
got into a fight
in this Rakshasa Temple.

111
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,800
Young Lady Qi feared
something bad would happen

112
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:22,360
and sent me to mediate,

113
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,800
only to be framed by you.

114
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:26,310
You adulteress, how dare
you twist the truth like this!

115
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,120
No.

116
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,680
That's not how it happened.

117
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,830
Both Butcher Xu and Ding Chengyong's
bodies are right here.

118
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,480
And this.

119
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:32,860
(Xiu)

120
00:06:33,270 --> 00:06:35,630
This was found in Ding Chengyong's home.

121
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,720
How are you going
to explain yourself, you adulteress?

122
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,830
Confess already.

123
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,160
Committing adultery

124
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,430
and causing human lives to be lost...

125
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,560
Heaven will not tolerate this.

126
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,630
Light the fire.

127
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:45,630
No.

128
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:48,600
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

129
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,600
That's not true.

130
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:50,360
Everyone...

131
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,040
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

132
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,920
Mr. Steward,

133
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,950
since she raised me,

134
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:58,750
please let me talk to
my mother for a moment.

135
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:10,950
How does it feel to have
your reputation ruined?

136
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:13,160
It really was you
who gave the undergarment

137
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,360
to Ding Chengyong.

138
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:16,190
Now you dare to frame me,

139
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,720
you jerk!

140
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,270
Eighteen years ago,

141
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,510
you used your role
as a wet nurse to swap the babies,

142
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:25,360
reducing me,
the true daughter, to this state.

143
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:27,720
Now that the Marquis Residence
has come looking for me,

144
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,190
you want to ruin my purity again.

145
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:34,000
You just want your fake daughter, Jin,

146
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:36,750
to sit comfortably in
the Marquis Residence without a worry.

147
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,680
If you dare to lay a finger on Jin,

148
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,240
I won't let you off even as a ghost.

149
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:43,160
I will kill you!

150
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,390
I'm already an evil ghost

151
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:46,160
that crawled out of the underworld.

152
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:47,950
This debt of blood...

153
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,390
We'll start

154
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:55,160
with your precious Jin.

155
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,950
You jerk!

156
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,750
I will kill you!

157
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:05,000
Mother,

158
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:06,920
please don't kill me.

159
00:08:06,990 --> 00:08:07,650
Mother.

160
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:08,690
- Please...
- Jerk.

161
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:09,640
Jerk!

162
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,680
Mother,

163
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,480
I beg you.

164
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,510
Unrepentant till the end,

165
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,480
utterly malicious.

166
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,000
Execute.

167
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,120
No.

168
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:16,950
No.

169
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:18,390
I'm innocent.

170
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,870
I'm innocent.

171
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,120
Jerk!

172
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,830
Jerk!

173
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,270
Just go to heck!

174
00:08:45,260 --> 00:08:47,580
(Inner Manor of the Qi Residence,
Peaceful Residence)

175
00:08:51,910 --> 00:08:54,360
- Welcome back, Young Lady.
- Welcome back, Young Lady.

176
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:56,750
(Heaven grants me
a second chance in this game.)

177
00:08:57,270 --> 00:09:00,510
(This time, I will be the weiqi player,)

178
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:02,600
(not a pawn on the board.)

179
00:09:03,060 --> 00:09:05,940
(Qi Jin, fake daughter
of Yongping Marquis)

180
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:12,630
So what if Qi Yuan has returned?

181
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,480
The Young Lady of the Qi family

182
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,080
can only be me.

183
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,790
Whoever blocks my path...

184
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:25,270
Whoever steals my position...

185
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,320
- Deities in my way will fall.
- Deities in my way will fall.

186
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:31,720
- Buddha in my way will fall.
- Buddha in my way will fall.

187
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:51,060
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

188
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:55,220
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

189
00:09:55,730 --> 00:10:01,190
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

190
00:10:01,410 --> 00:10:05,570
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

191
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:10,640
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

192
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:18,340
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
